        terms: [("About STRÖM and our philosophy", "STRÖM is a light, beautiful BitTorrent client for macOS. We believe a tool should be fast, quiet and simple, should leave you in control (you can switch off sharing with other peers), and should respect your privacy: no hidden tracking, no ads, nothing sold."), ("Free use and STRÖM Plus", "The core features are free, without a time limit. STRÖM Plus is a one-time payment for one Mac and adds convenience features. A license key is personal: it must not be shared, resold or published. To move Plus to another Mac, deactivate it on the old one or contact support."), ("Your responsibility for content", "BitTorrent is a neutral technology. STRÖM does not host, offer or check any files. You alone are responsible for what you download and share, and for complying with the laws of your country, including copyright law. Do not use STRÖM to infringe the rights of others."), ("No warranty, limited liability", "STRÖM is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. To the extent permitted by law, the rights holder is not liable for damage arising from its use. Mandatory rights you have as a consumer remain unaffected."), ("Source code license", "The source code is published on GitHub under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0: you may read, change and use it for personal and non-commercial purposes. Selling the app, paid forks or commercial use without permission are not allowed. Third-party components (libtorrent, OpenSSL) keep their own licenses."), ("Applicable law and contact", "Swiss law applies, as far as the law of your country does not mandatorily provide otherwise. Questions, requests and complaints: info@oskarreus.ch."), ("Legal texts", "The main legal texts behind these terms are listed below the text. Opening them is your choice; the app does not send anything when you do."), ("Changes", "If these terms change in a way that matters, STRÖM shows them again and asks for your acceptance. The current version is shown in the title of this window.")],
        privacy: [("Cookies", "The STRÖM app uses no cookies and no tracking technologies. The pages of our own server (license key page, key recovery page) set no cookies either. The payment page is operated by Stripe, which may use cookies under its own privacy policy."), ("What never leaves your Mac", "Your torrent list, file names, magnet links, downloaded files, settings and the peers you connect to stay on your Mac. We never receive them."), ("Purchase and license data", "When you buy Plus, Stripe processes the payment; we never see your card data. We keep the e-mail address you give at checkout only to send and restore your key. To bind one license to one Mac the app sends a technical device key, never your name. We also record that you accepted these terms: version, time and your choices. If you activate Plus, this record is linked to your license so we can show proof of acceptance. Each license check also records its time, so we can see whether a license is still in use."), ("Update check", "Once a day (and when you press “Check now”) STRÖM asks our server whether a new version exists. The request carries no name, e-mail, license key or device key, and our server does not store the IP address. You can switch this off in Settings. A new version is never installed by itself: you download it yourself."), ("Anonymous usage statistics (optional)", "Only if you allow it, STRÖM sends once a day: number of launches, active time, number of completed downloads, total gigabytes downloaded and uploaded, app version, macOS version and interface language. Purpose: to improve the service. Never sent: file names, links, content, e-mail, license key or IP address."), ("How statistics are protected", "Statistics use a random installation number created by the app. We do not link it to your name, e-mail, license or device key, and we do not store IP addresses. Data is stored only on our own server, is never sold or passed on, and is deleted after 24 months at the latest. Our 